==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*9 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3~6 seconds<sup>90f~180f</sup>.
*9 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*9 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
*6 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Sunrise Doge]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use cheap cats because [[Sunrise Doge]] is considered a metal enemy. Using cats like Cow Cat and its variants is a very good strategy but don't save up for anything that does crits, it's not worth it for the time.

